# Binary formats are never line-ending converted.
#
# Git decides "text" by looking for NUL bytes. A PDF whose streams are ASCII85 or hex-encoded has none, so with
# core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout rewrote every LF in tools/fixtures/reportlab/reportlab-scan-1p.pdf as CRLF:
# 305,940 bytes committed, 306,036 checked out, every xref offset wrong (found 16 September 2026, on the commit that
# added it). Listed by extension, not left to detection.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm  binary
*.gz    binary
*.zip   binary
